@startuml
title PWA blackout and replay - SRS proposal, not existing API
actor "Field Staff" as Staff
participant "PWA Client" as PWA
database "IndexedDB (on device)" as Local
participant "Sync Adapter (proposed)" as Sync
participant "API Gateway" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB
Staff -> PWA: Submit report / signed QR receipt while offline
PWA -> Local: Store command + stable idempotency key
Local --> PWA: Queued locally
PWA --> Staff: Pending sync (NOT server-confirmed delivery)
... connectivity restored ...
loop Replay pending commands in order
PWA -> Sync: Resume replay
Sync -> Local: Get queued command
Sync -> API: HTTPS operation + same Idempotency-Key
API -> DB: Authenticate, validate and dedupe
alt Successful commit or safe duplicate
DB --> API: Stable receipt
API --> Sync: 200/201 receipt
Sync -> Local: Mark synced
else Business conflict
DB --> API: 409 conflict
API --> Sync: Conflict + resolution reason
Sync -> Local: Retain for manual resolution
end
end
PWA --> Staff: Show canonical state only after server ack
note over PWA,DB
Offline sync endpoints and signed-QR proof format
are SRS extensions and require a versioned contract.
end note
@enduml
